  "label": "Stereotype of a vengeful or patient avenger",
  "description": "The phrase 'I have a good memory and a lot of patience' is a common trope in fiction and real-life intimidation, implying that the speaker will not forget past wrongs and will wait for the right moment to exact revenge. This stereotype is used to amplify the threat and instill fear in the target, relying on the audience's understanding of this cultural archetype.",
